"(в бутылках и коробках)."

#. module: micro_brewery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:micro_brewery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"We setup an example of this setup with the lager and brown beer bottle and "
"box products in this module."
msgstr ""
"Мы настроили пример этого сценария в модуле, используя товары: «Лагер» и "
"«Темное пиво» (в бутылках и коробках)."

#. module: micro_brewery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:micro_brewery.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We're a small, independent brewery set where the tide meets the city. Every "
"batch is brewed slow, shaped by salt air, and made to be shared."
msgstr ""

#. module: micro_brewery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:micro_brewery.view_page_home
